{"date": "2020-10-04", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/1004.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:37:01+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "4ea714e090667f34c314dc176ee17778821f36892a11e1e42d2675d465962219", "image_bytes": 120495, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 28 Sep 2020 11:30:48 GMT", "title": "宜翻书", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "樱桃的滋味", "author": "阿巴斯·基阿鲁斯达米", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "暗中绝望、感觉忧郁时，我远离野心的狂流，伸手拿一本诗集，便立刻想起围绕着我们的无尽的财富，想起沉浸在这样一个世界里的一生才是有尊严的一生。然后我松了一口气。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "ABBAS KIAROSTAMI"}
